","value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5236340","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1846651706691317","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"TINY SHOP DEMO IS LIVE NOW!","summary":"Hey!Steam Next Fest kicks off today, which means you can already hop into the Tiny Shop demo, check out new content, mechanics, and a whole lot more! Make sure to share your thoughts on the game, and if you wanna post your little shops on social media, don’t forget to use #TinyShopGame so we don’t miss your posts. We really wanna see what players can do ;)Also gotta mention that today you can play 4 more demos from Spaghetti Cat. They’re all different, but totally worth checking out:Brofish Goin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1839676055884550","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"50K WISHLISTS!! 🎉","summary":"So... 8 years. Eight years I’ve been chasing this dream of just making games full-time. And now it actually might be happening? I think? Hope so. Hi! We just hit 50,000 wishlists. That’s huge. Like, huge huge. And I owe that to every single one of you — so seriously, thank you. ❤️Since this is kind of a big deal, I wanted to write something personal. No PR fluff, just... me.I’m Rostislav. Just some indie dev. Trained as an architect, did arch-viz for a few years, then decided I wanted to make ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T08:15:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055884550","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1838407329259584","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"update","title":"Update & CBT! 🛠️","summary":"Hey everyone! We’ve been busy bees and made many changes to the game. First up, we completely revamped the tutorial – it’s way simpler and easier to get into now. We also tweaked a bunch of technical stuff and controls. For example, we’re want to know what you think about using Shift and Ctrl when placing items, does it feel smooth? Since these changes are super fresh, we ran a small closed test beforehand to gather early feedback. So, if you got that notification with access to the CBT – please","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T13:57:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1835236783570393","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Wrap-Up: your love vs. our bugs 🐛❤️","summary":"Hey shop owners!Two weeks of open playtest flew by like nothing, and now it's time to sum things up and share our next steps. Actually, it's been longer than two weeks, but you're seeing this post today because we've been glued to our screens with mugs of VERY… and I mean VERY strong tea. We've been going through your surveys (almost 2.5k of them!), collecting and analyzing your messages on socials, discussing all the feedback, checking in-game stats… and just couldn't believe our eyes.You know,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T14:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783570393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1833334318572529","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"update","title":"UPDATE!","summary":"Hey friends! Quick but important news. We've already gotten hundreds and hundreds of pieces of feedback from you, and we're already working on making the game better. Huge thanks for that! Right away, today we've put in the first big fixes that should make the gameplay smoother and more comfortable. So pretty please......if you've already played the game, could you hop back one more time on this playtest? ^^That way we can make sure all the changes we made are actually good for the game and for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T18:15:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572529","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1832700592800929","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"BIG NEWS!","summary":"Hey friends!Today’s a great day because we’ve done a ton of work on the game and want to share the results with you. First, you might’ve already seen the updated Steam store page design. What do you think? Second, we’ve polished and added a bunch of stuff to Tiny Shop, so we’re launching an official open playtest right now!Anyone can jump in, just hit that special button on the Steam page:Third: to celebrate, we made a brand new trailer: Also, we’d really love to see your little shops from the g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T13:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592800929","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1826992588595452","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"We're already 30,000!","summary":"Hello, friends! 👋Work on Tiny Shop is ongoing, and today we just wanted to share a wonderful milestone: more than 30,000 people have already added the game to their wishlist and, just like us, are eagerly awaiting the release ✨🥳We are absolutely thrilled by such support and interest from you all! 🤩A huge thank you!- The ScoreboardGames and Spaghetti Cat teamsP.S.If you haven't had a chance to add the game to your wishlist and/or join our social media yet — now is the perfect time! It really help","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-13T12:57:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588595452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1825093633188110","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"Holiday Gifts!","summary":"Hey friends!The Lunar New Year celebrations are in full swing, and we wanted to do two very important things. First, wish everyone a happy and wonderful holiday! Second, let you know that in Tiny Shop, we're planning to add a huge number of themed items so you can decorate your shop exactly the way you want. Both on an ongoing basis and in honor of real-world or in-game events. One of those events will be the Lunar New Year. During these events, the city administration will organize festivals, p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T15:17:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188110","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1805431065354495","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"Tiny Shop: sweet updates and something special! 🐾","summary":"Hi friends! 👋 Sorry I haven’t shared any updates in a while. I’ve been fully focused on working on the demo. Just a little more time, and in a couple of weeks I’ll be able to share details about the upcoming playtest 🎮✨While working on the game, I realized that a cozy little shop definitely needs a cozy little resident. What do you think should it be a panda 🐼 or a raccoon 🦝? And maybe you already have an idea for their name? And now, some more exciting news! Tiny Shop is part of the Steam SimFe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-18T02:12:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805431065354495","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649680-1797820624497967","game_id":"steam-3649680","kind":"announcement","title":"🌸 Welcome to Tiny Shop: Make It Cozy! 🌸","summary":"Hello everyone! My name is Rostislav, and I’m the solo developer behind Tiny Shop: Make It Cozy. I’m thrilled to finally share the game with you the Steam page is live, and so is our very first trailer! 🎉 You can check it out right here on the page. 🛒 What's Tiny Shop all about? Tiny Shop is a cozy and relaxing shop simulator where you decorate, manage, and sell charming little things handmade candles, soft knitted scarves, vintage flea market treasures, and more. Your shop sits on a quiet stree","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-25T16:15:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797820624497967","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3649680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3649680":"2026-10-26T10:40:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3649680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:47Z","status":"ok",